 "title": "Genus of a smooth plane curve of degree d",
 "caption": "The genus (d − 1)(d − 2)/2 grows quadratically with the degree: lines and conics have genus 0, a cubic has genus 1 (a torus, an elliptic curve) and a quartic has genus 3.",
