 "description": [
  "Plot g = (d − 1)(d − 2)/2 against the degree d.",
  "The cubic, d = 3, gives 2 × 1/2 = 1: a torus.",
  "The quartic, d = 4, gives 3 × 2/2 = 3.",
  "Lines (d = 1) and conics (d = 2) both give genus 0."
